{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game is &quot;Safe For Work&quot;, generally rated as ages 13+! While there is a theme of Spankin', it's all in fun, get your mind out of the gutter!</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>OVERVIEW</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You're a 12 year old gamer in the 90's. You snuck your Mom's forbidden game, <strong>Big Booty Slapper 6</strong>, onto your dusty bedroom PC while she was asleep. But when you boot it up, something\u2019s wrong. A shapeshifting virus named Spunk has taken over, and he's eating your precious game from the inside out.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Armed with GlitchSPANKR antivirus software (and a floppy pink hand on a stick), dive into corrupted worlds of broken code where every level plays differently to hunt the virus.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But Spunk isn\u2019t just a villain, he\u2019s lonely, unstable, and might just hold the future of the world in his non-existent hands. You can destroy him. You can befriend him. You might even.... fall in love?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your path, unlock hidden endings, customize your SpankStick, decorate your digital HQ, and maybe even save your game from total deletion. Or don\u2019t. Your future is in your floppy, flailing hand.</i><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/877f9772af31fc7d10c50ef664c7da00.avif?t=1767669489\" width=617 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/28b2ed6822ba8e04cdaa014d6fa45115.poster.avif?t=1767669489\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/28b2ed6822ba8e04cdaa014d6fa45115.webm?t=1767669489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><i>Your trusty weapon is a floppy pink hand on a bendy metal rod, and it's got one job: spank everything. Use it to solve problems, punish viruses, and destroy almost anything in your path. It wiggles. It whistles when you whip it around. It breaks stuff.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With physics-based smacking and destructin\u2019, almost everything is breakable or interactive. Is your hand wet? Find an air blower. On fire? That\u2019s your problem now. Lights, furniture, emotions: smack that crap outta here. Especially that talking toilet.</i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/293ac4ccdaf34b4a7ba5f6662685b4de.avif?t=1767669489\" width=617 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/5f383fe94ceb80433c70d5170e93e857.poster.avif?t=1767669489\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/5f383fe94ceb80433c70d5170e93e857.webm?t=1767669489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><i>Every decision reshapes the story. Will you try to destroy Spunk for corrupting your beloved Big Booty Slapper 6? Spare him and try building a friendship? Or follow your instincts into something you were never meant to find?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>GlitchSPANKR features fully branching paths with wildly different levels, mechanics, secrets, and endings. Hunt him. Love him. Regret everything. Then start over and choose differently. You might even stumble upon a deeper conspiracy along the way. </i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/6bc67d8da7ee7aa988790b3842b34d14.avif?t=1767669489\" width=617 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/333d6522b93a35d4354365dada385c88.poster.avif?t=1767669489\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/333d6522b93a35d4354365dada385c88.webm?t=1767669489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><i>Secret folders. Forgotten levels. Strange messages buried beneath the code. GlitchSPANKR is packed with things the virus doesn\u2019t want you to find.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Complete challenges, collect loot, and unlock new customizations for your SpankStick. Decorate your SPANKR HQ, show off trophies, and maybe, just maybe, uncover the real reason the virus is devouring your game.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/2ad93baa5369a804b2960c00a2575ac3.avif?t=1767669489\" width=617 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/532149dc522c892d0f49f16b1e75b792.poster.avif?t=1767669489\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/532149dc522c892d0f49f16b1e75b792.webm?t=1767669489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><i>Unlock weird furniture, customize your SpankStick at the Spankulator 9000, collect rare loot and questionable trophies. Then bring them all home to SPANKR HQ. It\u2019s your customizable clubhouse, your digital bedroom, and your memory vault rolled into one.</i><br><br><i>Display your secrets. Lovingly spank your unlocked pets. Blast your favorite unlockable songs. Choose your outdoor backgrounds. Visit the Fan Art Gallery (and submit your own). This is your safe space\u2026 probably. Just avoid that scary evil demon door in the basement.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/c105e887a9ec221b68a9827a4afac9af.avif?t=1767669489\" width=500 height=119 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Glitch Spanker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2727660/0314e6747a47f729e8d209cb3b3ca325415913cd.jpg"},{"name":"Guardian Angel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2727660/f4d53345b404b3fde19a4abc76621faa20b8cf3d.jpg"},{"name":"No Friend of Mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2727660/20e7e390c7433bfd787dbf152408c6b76e08946d.jpg"},{"name":"Spank Saber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2727660/1ab3e997fdda25e0bc0ed9ae7936ad57b314a125.jpg"},{"name":"Sir Spanksalot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2727660/6c93f2b6fd6cc75f46c9215d7bd2e7b5a1be8493.jpg"},{"name":"Not a Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2727660/2ec6c233d972d8b5bf0101b46cdf286b4ba74992.jpg"},{"name":"Lil Sweetie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2727660/afaec56219ca0b6f77e9922266abc97baed84a15.jpg"},{"name":"Blackout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2727660/070bf32323668ddbd45145631c20dd645bbf45f2.jpg"},{"name":"When in Doubt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2727660/f9146e1a64c7cd6cade29778ee2030d788c78eac.jpg"},{"name":"My Special Stick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2727660/159477ec30d