=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/2ad93baa5369a804b2960c00a2575ac3.avif?t=1767669489\" width=617 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/532149dc522c892d0f49f16b1e75b792.poster.avif?t=1767669489\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/532149dc522c892d0f49f16b1e75b792.webm?t=1767669489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><i>Unlock weird furniture, customize your SpankStick at the Spankulator 9000, collect rare loot and questionable trophies. Then bring them all home to SPANKR HQ. It\u2019s your customizable clubhouse, your digital bedroom, and your memory vault rolled into one.</i><br><br><i>Display your secrets. Lovingly spank your unlocked pets. Blast your favorite unlockable songs. Choose your outdoor backgrounds. Visit the Fan Art Gallery (and submit your own). This is your safe space\u2026 probably. Just avoid that scary evil demon door in the basement.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/c105e887a9ec221b68a9827a4afac9af.avif?t=1767669489\" width=500 height=119 /></span></p>","developers":["Mahelyk","TheClassifiedX"],"dlc":[4151500],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/header.jpg?t=1767669489","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2727660/2045595123/58f4562cc99e87451ebe53fed6a7b5ad2133e546/1760902091/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760905254","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamst